  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>A message from Dana</h3>
    <p>Dana texts a coworker after a chaotic morning.</p>
    <p><span class="ex">“Sorry I’m late! What a morning. I woke up late, got up in a hurry, and put on yesterday’s shirt. Then I couldn’t find my keys, so I looked for them for ten minutes. They were in my coat. I ran out, got on the wrong bus, and had to get off at the mall and wait for the next one. Can you pick me up tomorrow? I give up on buses.”</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Good reading. You followed a very bad morning, chunk by chunk.">
