  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Explain the system</h3>
    <p>Complete this aloud: “A phrasal verb is a verb plus a small word, and together they make a ______ meaning. I learn the two words as one ______. With a pronoun, the small word comes after it: turn it ______, pick me ______.”</p>
    <p>Then say two true sentences about today using two different chunks from this lesson.</p>
  </div>

